u(up)`, `down` matmul, `combine` sum,
`sigmoid(shared_gate)`). The `moe_topk` kernel is a reference implementation (no fast path yet); the `moe_experts`
kernel is the NVFP4 GEMV split-K (the one that holds the Spark bar).

## Admission cases (when a kernel is allowed)

`quant::moe::AdmissionCase` (checked by `Op::validate`):

| Case | When |
|---|---|
| `bf16` | `dtype == bf16` |

